    "description": "LAMY Rose Gold Tone Pen Set with Kaweco Tin Case\nWriting Instruments & Storage Tin\nAnodized Aluminum, Modern Era\nThis fine writing instrument set includes two capped pens finished in a refined metallic rose gold tone, paired with an embossed Kaweco metal storage tin. Known for precision German industrial design, these writing instruments feature lightweight anodized aluminum construction, ergonomic contours, and distinctive spring-action wire pocket clips. Housed together in a collectible vintage-style presentation tin, this pairing offers both practical utility and sophisticated aesthetic appeal.\nIncludes two full-size capped pens featuring anodized rose gold finish and signature wire clips\nBarrel on one pen is visibly marked with the classic LAMY logo engraving\nIntegrated ink viewing windows on both pen barrels for monitoring ink levels\nPresented inside an embossed Kaweco hinged metal storage tin with contoured interior tray\nTin dimensions measure approximately 9.2 inches by 2.4 inches\nCondition:\nPre-owned condition. Pen bodies show light handling wear with clean anodized surfaces and intact clips. Writing mechanisms and ink cartridges are untested. Kaweco tin opens and closes securely with minor exterior surface rub and light scuffs typical of gentle storage. Interior tray insert remains intact.",
